       </div><button type="submit" class="generic-submit w-full py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white text-sm transition-all hover:opacity-90 flex items-center justify-center gap-2" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #fbbf24);"> <i data-lucide="send" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i> <span>Enviar Sugestão</span> </button>
